From 28125816a6e96fa046c46a90d32f55cbfec341df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2025 15:41:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] i2c: i2c-qcom-geni: Add APIs to support CCU QUP client

Add follwing new exported APIs to support CCU QUP client,
- Bus recovery feature: Support recovery of IOS lines in both FIFO
and GSI modes during data transfers.
- Configure serial engine mode: Allow client to configure serial
engine mode in CDM or sync trigger mode, and set GPII channel
type to sync ch0, sync ch1, or regular channel.
- GPII reset feature: Enable client to initiate reset of any
particular GPII or all GPIIs of SE.

Apart from this added support for priority data transfer on
regular channel if priority bit is set.

Change-Id: Id8c7c7b18a8f9d631f3b208346d6f126aded2116

Signed-off-by: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
